01:37.320 --> 01:39.410
There we go.

01:39.780 --> 01:41.450
My name is Asami.

01:41.450 --> 01:43.620
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:44.040 --> 01:47.580
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:47.580 --> 01:49.290
I'm actually married.

01:49.290 --> 01:50.750
My husband,

01:50.750 --> 01:52.500
Asami.

01:53.380 --> 01:55.720
Good morning, Darling.

01:56.170 --> 02:00.640
Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches physics at my school.

02:01.220 --> 02:02.220
Good morning.

02:02.310 --> 02:07.190
Welcome to Our School Festival ♥

02:08.600 --> 02:09.770
A café?

02:09.770 --> 02:12.270
Yes, all the girls in my class
are running one.

02:12.270 --> 02:14.110
I hope you can come.

02:14.110 --> 02:15.900
I wouldn't miss it for the world.

02:18.400 --> 02:20.160
I'm heading out.

02:20.160 --> 02:21.320
Goodbye.

02:22.530 --> 02:24.200
In fact, today...

02:23.370 --> 02:25.910
"12th Annual May Festival"

02:24.200 --> 02:27.540
...is the day of the school festival.

02:37.090 --> 02:39.220
"Cherry Tree Garden Café"

02:37.630 --> 02:39.180
Nooo!

02:41.010 --> 02:43.510
I'm so ashamed!

02:43.510 --> 02:45.390
These are soo revealing.

02:45.390 --> 02:47.270
There's no other options?

02:47.270 --> 02:48.680
Stop complaining.

02:49.230 --> 02:52.440
You two said we could handle the uniforms, right?

02:52.440 --> 02:53.690
But...

02:53.900 --> 02:56.030
My chest is much smaller than yours.

02:56.030 --> 02:59.700
A bust is a terrible thing to mind,
and we've got customers coming our way.

03:00.070 --> 03:03.370
If my husband saw me dressed this way...

03:03.870 --> 03:05.410
Get a move on!

03:05.410 --> 03:06.580
Think we're the first ones in?

03:06.580 --> 03:07.700
Might be...

03:08.330 --> 03:10.000
Welcome!

03:16.670 --> 03:19.840
Thank you all for coming
to our planetarium.

03:20.220 --> 03:22.390
Today, the Astronomy Club

03:22.390 --> 03:26.010
will guide you through the amazing world of the constellations.

03:26.350 --> 03:29.520
The night sky in spring is often obscured by mist.

03:29.980 --> 03:31.520
Now, on to summer.

03:32.150 --> 03:35.690
The Milky Way lies near the constellations of Sagittarius and Scorpio.

03:36.230 --> 03:38.230
"Astronomy Club Planetarium"

03:36.650 --> 03:38.940
He doesn't seem trustworthy, but...

03:38.940 --> 03:41.900
...at least that teacher's
competent at his job.

03:42.570 --> 03:44.320
And now...

03:44.320 --> 03:46.740
I just wonder what Asami's up to.

03:49.370 --> 03:52.080
There's two hours
before the next exhibition.

03:52.080 --> 03:53.750
Vice-Principal?

03:54.040 --> 03:55.080
What is it?

03:55.080 --> 03:58.090
The truth is... they've got
such and such, et cetera...

03:58.090 --> 03:59.760
So I hear.

03:59.760 --> 04:01.010
But is it true?

04:00.720 --> 04:01.800
Oh yes.

04:01.800 --> 04:03.590
We'll have to investigate.

04:03.590 --> 04:05.010
Do we ever!

04:07.850 --> 04:10.680
The principal has got it bad.

04:10.680 --> 04:13.850
The Vice-Principal is constantly pointing out mistakes.

04:14.150 --> 04:18.320
The Principal's always afraid of getting ratted out to his superiors.

04:19.440 --> 04:21.690
Ichimaru-sensei!

04:22.030 --> 04:23.530
Come with me!

04:26.990 --> 04:29.700
Have you heard about class 2-B?

04:30.910 --> 04:33.710
It's mega-popular. Want to take a look?

04:34.250 --> 04:36.420
That's Asami's and her friends' café.

04:37.290 --> 04:39.420
It's so embarrassing.

04:39.800 --> 04:41.590
Everybody's leering at us!

04:41.590 --> 04:42.800
Cope with it.

04:42.800 --> 04:44.430
Satomi, are you okay?

04:44.430 --> 04:48.350
I have to be! If we can't cope with it,
customers won't stop by.

04:48.930 --> 04:50.850
Copious quantities of cleavage.

04:51.930 --> 04:54.310
And scandalously short skirts.

04:54.310 --> 04:55.730
They're nothing if not bold.

04:55.730 --> 04:56.730
Right?

04:56.730 --> 04:59.110
But hey, there's only one festival a year.

04:59.110 --> 05:00.780
Should we let it slide?

05:00.780 --> 05:03.400
We ought to savor this rare experience.

05:03.400 --> 05:04.450
Yes!

05:06.570 --> 05:08.200
Welcome!

05:10.370 --> 05:13.040
We have two more customers!

05:12.660 --> 05:14.290
Come in!

05:13.750 --> 05:15.410
A-Asami...

05:16.750 --> 05:19.000
Darling...

05:19.790 --> 05:21.500
Welcome.

05:22.380 --> 05:24.760
W-What would you like to order?

05:26.760 --> 05:27.340
U-Umm...

05:27.340 --> 05:28.760
Coffee for two.

05:32.060 --> 05:33.810
I'll bring them now.

05:43.190 --> 05:46.070
What're you doing, Ichimaru-sensei?

05:46.780 --> 05:47.820
Umm... N-Nothing!

05:48.160 --> 05:49.740
Sorry to keep you waiting.

05:55.830 --> 05:57.540
The hell was that for!?

05:57.540 --> 06:00.290
Oh, umm... Nothing. Just a little fly...

06:02.420 --> 06:04.960
P-Please take as long as you need.

06:20.440 --> 06:24.070
Well then... Where is Asami's classroom?

06:24.110 --> 06:27.110
2-A Flea Market
2-B Cherry Tree Garden Café
2-C Maze
2-D Fortunetelling
Art Room - Art Club Exhibition

06:27.110 --> 06:29.570
Hm? A café, huh?

06:31.740 --> 06:34.660
Guess I'll take a little coffee break.

06:35.950 --> 06:38.580
That girl there is the greatest!

06:39.040 --> 06:41.460
She's so incredibly cute!

06:41.460 --> 06:44.090
Those uniforms are the best thing ever!

06:44.590 --> 06:48.130
I'm so envious! I mean, public face-sitting?

06:48.130 --> 06:50.010
That was awesome, Sensei.

06:50.010 --> 06:52.890
Even I could never go <i>that</i> far.

06:54.180 --> 06:55.390
Welcome.

06:57.770 --> 07:00.100
We will show you to your seat.

07:00.100 --> 07:01.480
Follow us!

07:00.520 --> 07:01.480
Her father.

07:02.810 --> 07:04.690
Ichimaru-sensei?

07:07.440 --> 07:09.950
If he sees her like that...

07:09.950 --> 07:13.120
This is so bad; I have to fool him.

07:14.120 --> 07:15.410
Asami.

07:16.290 --> 07:18.120
Here, here.

07:18.750 --> 07:20.120
Hurry up and hide.

07:20.120 --> 07:22.120
Your father's here.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.920
Orange Pekoe.

07:23.920 --> 07:25.000
I'll bring it now.

07:26.300 --> 07:27.630
Do it now, or else!

07:44.270 --> 07:45.820
F-Father...

07:50.280 --> 07:54.780
On sign: 2-B Cherry Tree Garden Cafe Up Here

07:50.490 --> 07:53.990
WHAT THE HELL DO YOU THINK YOU'RE DOING!?!?

08:02.080 --> 08:03.080
Bastard...

08:08.170 --> 08:11.050
What in tarnation are you doing to my little girl!?

08:11.050 --> 08:12.590
Oh shoo-

08:14.550 --> 08:16.850
V-Vice Principal!

08:19.100 --> 08:22.100
Sick sorry excuse for a teacher!

08:38.410 --> 08:39.830
Take this, and this...

08:39.830 --> 08:41.450
That hurt?

08:41.450 --> 08:42.710
Idiot!

08:42.710 --> 08:45.920
I-It isn't me you want...

08:46.580 --> 08:48.130
Dammit!

08:49.500 --> 08:51.800
How many more times
do I have to tell you?!

08:51.800 --> 08:55.510
My husband didn't do anything,
and had nothing to do with this!

08:55.510 --> 08:56.590
My husband-

08:56.590 --> 08:59.220
"My husband" this, "my husband" that!
You're sounding like a broken record!

08:59.220 --> 09:02.480
I still haven't given you two my approval, you know.

09:02.480 --> 09:04.940
And how'd they let that pervert stand in front of a classroom?

09:05.390 --> 09:08.810
He practically gets off just looking at you!

09:10.070 --> 09:11.480
He does?

09:18.990 --> 09:20.950
I'm leaving!

09:20.950 --> 09:22.540
Father...

09:25.370 --> 09:28.880
"Cherry Tree Garden Café"

09:26.210 --> 09:28.880
We haven't had any traffic
since that incident.

09:28.880 --> 09:30.590
No surprise there...

09:30.920 --> 09:34.010
We're completely out of commission!

09:36.010 --> 09:37.930
But thanks to that...

09:38.510 --> 09:39.930
Also in the summer.

09:39.930 --> 09:43.140
The Milky Way is near the constellations of Sagittarius and Scorpio.

09:43.140 --> 09:46.810
Also in the same vicinity are the stars featured in the Tanabata festival,

09:46.810 --> 09:50.060
Orihime and Hikoboshi,
also known as Vega and Altair.

09:52.570 --> 09:54.400
We got some free time.

09:54.400 --> 09:58.570
So we went to the planetarium,
among other places.

10:02.490 --> 10:03.830
And...

10:03.830 --> 10:05.080
I'm home.

10:07.870 --> 10:11.290
Welcome home, Darling.

10:12.000 --> 10:14.710
Will you be taking your bath now, Darling?

10:14.710 --> 10:16.630
Or would you rather have dinner?

10:16.630 --> 10:18.630
U-Umm...

10:20.840 --> 10:22.300
L-Let's see...

10:27.850 --> 10:29.270
I...

10:31.190 --> 10:35.690
You were the only one whom
I wanted to see me like this.

10:36.490 --> 10:40.160
Because I want to be
your very own Asami.

10:40.950 --> 10:42.410
That is why...

10:44.370 --> 10:47.160
Thank you, Asami. That makes me happy.

10:47.160 --> 10:48.620
Darling...!

10:49.790 --> 10:52.290
I think I'll take a bath first.

10:52.290 --> 10:52.960
Sure.

10:52.960 --> 10:55.170
Oh, before I do...

10:59.430 --> 11:01.390
D-Darling...

11:01.390 --> 11:03.140
Asami.

11:05.390 --> 11:06.770
Darling...

11:15.980 --> 11:17.940
My husband...

11:18.610 --> 11:21.990
Even though he's always acting bashful,
or overly serious...

11:23.030 --> 11:24.240
I'm still happy.

11:26.410 --> 11:29.330
Darling, I'm so in love with you.

11:34.460 --> 11:36.300
My name is Asami.

11:36.300 --> 11:38.550
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

11:38.960 --> 11:41.010
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

11:41.800 --> 11:45.050
I'm actually married.

11:46.180 --> 11:50.230
My husband teaches physics at my school. His name is...

11:50.980 --> 11:52.350
Oh, good morning.

11:52.730 --> 11:54.690
...Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei.

11:55.310 --> 11:56.650
Good morning.

11:56.650 --> 12:00.070
Shall we have breakfast? It's already ready.

12:00.610 --> 12:03.160
Sorry, but I have to get going now.

12:03.160 --> 12:04.280
I'm sorry.

12:04.280 --> 12:07.620
Yesterday was so hectic that I wasn't
able to finish today's lesson plans.

12:07.620 --> 12:11.710
No way... I worked so hard
to make it for you.

12:12.210 --> 12:15.040
U-Umm, Darling, what time will you...?

12:15.420 --> 12:17.590
When should I have dinner ready?

12:18.130 --> 12:21.670
Well, I have to supervise
the Astronomy Club...

12:21.970 --> 12:23.550
Oh, that's right.

12:25.340 --> 12:27.050
I-I'm so sorry...

12:27.970 --> 12:32.940
We Had a Child...!

12:34.690 --> 12:36.110
<i>That's how it goes.</i>

12:36.560 --> 12:39.730
<i>My husband has been
very busy these days.</i>

12:46.740 --> 12:48.160
So cute!

12:58.920 --> 13:00.960
Using the gravitational lenses,

13:01.260 --> 13:03.470
we can see quasars, galaxies, and...

13:03.470 --> 13:07.340
I haven't been able to eat many meals...

13:07.340 --> 13:11.470
...or have relaxed conversations with my husband these days.

13:11.470 --> 13:13.890
I know he's busy with his work.

13:15.060 --> 13:16.480
But, I...

13:17.600 --> 13:19.110
...feel so alone.

13:23.190 --> 13:25.200
Huh? Our club activities?

13:25.200 --> 13:29.200
You've been looking depressed lately; you gotta get some exercise!

13:30.120 --> 13:31.830
You're right.

13:32.540 --> 13:34.660
<i>It beats sitting around the house.</i>

13:36.210 --> 13:38.670
Fight on, Onohara-senpai.

13:48.640 --> 13:50.140
Here it comes!

13:57.100 --> 13:58.940
That's <i>got</i> to hurt...

14:00.810 --> 14:03.940
So you're that interested in tennis,
Ichimaru-sensei?

14:03.940 --> 14:06.110
S-Sort of, yeah.

14:10.070 --> 14:11.620
Man, she sucks...

14:12.410 --> 14:13.990
This time...!

14:14.330 --> 14:16.080
Senpai~

14:17.460 --> 14:20.790
I can't bear to watch!
What's <i>with</i> that girl?

14:20.790 --> 14:23.550
Y-You shouldn't say things like that.

14:23.550 --> 14:25.550
She's doing her very best!

14:25.550 --> 14:27.550
I-Ichimaru-sensei.

14:27.550 --> 14:30.550
W-Why so serious?

14:30.550 --> 14:33.060
W-Well, you see, uhh...

14:34.890 --> 14:41.900
Blueberry Ice Cream

14:35.180 --> 14:36.270
Well done.

14:36.270 --> 14:37.680
Thank you.

14:38.140 --> 14:41.900
So, were you able to
sweat out your problems a bit?

14:44.190 --> 14:45.780
Thank you.

14:48.490 --> 14:50.910
That's right, tomorrow's Sunday.

14:51.820 --> 14:55.700
I'll ask Darling if he'll
take me out somewhere.

14:58.910 --> 15:00.920
The kitten from this morning.

15:01.380 --> 15:03.380
It's probably hungry.

15:03.880 --> 15:05.920
Hold on a sec.

15:13.760 --> 15:15.600
Let's see...

15:18.060 --> 15:19.640
Thanks for waiting.

15:37.700 --> 15:39.120
So cute...

15:42.580 --> 15:45.170
Hey, are you full now?

15:46.130 --> 15:48.170
That's great.

15:52.130 --> 15:55.220
You're on your own, aren't you?

15:56.220 --> 15:58.220
Aren't you lonely?

15:58.770 --> 16:00.480
You <i>are</i> lonely, aren't you?

16:01.940 --> 16:05.480
I know; why don't you become my child?

16:05.900 --> 16:08.030
I'll ask him if it's okay.

16:11.780 --> 16:13.200
I'm home.

16:13.200 --> 16:15.200
Sorry for being so late every night.

16:15.700 --> 16:17.200
What have you been looking at?

16:20.750 --> 16:23.370
"Japanese Bobtail"

16:22.040 --> 16:23.370
This.

16:23.670 --> 16:25.540
Isn't he cute?

16:25.540 --> 16:26.880
Sure, but...

16:27.420 --> 16:30.420
I'm more of a dog person.

16:30.420 --> 16:32.340
They're always so full of energy.

16:32.930 --> 16:34.760
Are you going out?

16:34.760 --> 16:35.390
Yeah.

16:35.760 --> 16:40.020
I have to finish the lesson plans for astronomical observations today.

16:40.020 --> 16:41.390
I'm sorry.

16:41.390 --> 16:45.810
I was hoping you'd stay in longer, like you usually do on Sundays.

16:45.810 --> 16:47.770
I'll start preparing breakfast.

16:47.770 --> 16:48.900
Don't worry about it.

16:49.190 --> 16:51.190
I don't have a lot of time.

16:56.910 --> 17:00.290
He has to go to work,
even though it's Sunday.

17:00.870 --> 17:04.540
But I won't feel lonely, because...

17:05.790 --> 17:07.790
You're with me.

17:07.790 --> 17:09.040
You...

17:09.630 --> 17:12.710
You need a name. What can I call you?

17:12.710 --> 17:15.180
You have such cute and intense eyes...

17:13.800 --> 17:18.220
Note: "kuritto" = big and round, kuri = chestnut

17:15.180 --> 17:17.680
"Kuri". Do you like that name?

17:21.640 --> 17:24.270
I'd really like to bring you home...

17:24.270 --> 17:28.900
But it seems like my husband prefers dogs. Sorry.

17:29.360 --> 17:34.240
Oh Kuri, I'd love to play with you
forever and ever, but...

17:34.240 --> 17:37.320
I don't know when he'll get home,

17:37.320 --> 17:40.240
so I have to prepare dinner now.

17:40.530 --> 17:42.790
So this is goodbye until tomorrow.

17:57.590 --> 17:58.550
I'm sorry.

18:25.830 --> 18:28.120
I'll have to wash them again.

18:33.130 --> 18:34.880
Oh! Kuri!

18:39.800 --> 18:40.840
Not here...

18:42.350 --> 18:44.010
Where did you go?

18:44.010 --> 18:46.480
Kuri! Kuri!

18:47.480 --> 18:48.600
Kuri?

18:49.730 --> 18:51.230
Where are you?

18:52.900 --> 18:54.570
Kuri!

19:08.290 --> 19:10.790
Kuri! Where are you?

19:10.790 --> 19:12.330
Kuri!

19:21.340 --> 19:23.430
Where have you gone, Kuri?

19:23.760 --> 19:25.350
It's raining so hard...

19:30.230 --> 19:31.850
What's the matter, Asami?

19:32.150 --> 19:33.440
Darling.

19:33.440 --> 19:36.320
You're soaking wet, with no umbrella.

19:36.320 --> 19:38.360
Kuri... Kuri's gone!

19:39.030 --> 19:39.950
"Kuri"?

19:39.950 --> 19:41.660
A stray kitten.

19:41.660 --> 19:42.910
A kitten?

19:47.200 --> 19:48.830
I see.

19:48.830 --> 19:51.330
Hey, Kuri! Where are you?

19:51.960 --> 19:54.500
Kuri... Kuri!

19:56.920 --> 19:58.670
Kuri...

19:59.010 --> 20:00.970
Kuri! Kuri!

19:59.010 --> 20:00.970
Where are you?

20:00.970 --> 20:02.800
Kuri!

20:01.340 --> 20:02.760
Where are you!?

20:02.760 --> 20:04.340
Come here Kuri!

20:03.050 --> 20:04.340
Kuri!

20:06.300 --> 20:08.180
Come here, Kuri!

20:07.850 --> 20:08.810
Kuri!

20:08.810 --> 20:11.020
Kuri... Kuri!

20:11.020 --> 20:13.600
Where are you, Kuri?

20:18.650 --> 20:20.900
Where could Kuri have gotten to?

20:27.160 --> 20:28.410
Kuri!?

20:29.660 --> 20:31.870
Kuri? Kuri!

20:36.630 --> 20:37.840
Kuri!

20:39.340 --> 20:41.300
I'm so happy to see you safe.

20:44.220 --> 20:46.510
I was so worried, Kuri...

20:46.510 --> 20:49.600
You were all alone in the rain, weren't you?

20:52.060 --> 20:55.810
Loneliness... It's a sad emotion...

21:07.870 --> 21:09.620
Hey, Darling.

21:09.620 --> 21:11.490
I'd like to keep this kitten...

21:11.790 --> 21:13.580
...but you won't allow it, will you?

21:13.580 --> 21:14.790
It's all right.

21:14.790 --> 21:16.040
Really?!

21:16.330 --> 21:18.590
As long as you take care of it.

21:18.590 --> 21:20.340
All right!

21:20.340 --> 21:22.050
Isn't that wonderful, Kuri?

21:23.470 --> 21:25.970
I just had<i> to keep him.</i>

21:25.970 --> 21:29.550
<i>After all, it felt as if Kuri...</i>

21:29.050 --> 21:30.810
Do you really mean it?

21:29.550 --> 21:32.470
...had become something like our first child.

21:32.470 --> 21:35.140
Thank you so much, Darling!

21:38.020 --> 21:40.480
Do you like that, Kuri?

21:44.570 --> 21:47.030
Okay... we're done.

21:52.160 --> 21:57.500
And this is how our household gained a new family member.

22:16.060 --> 22:19.560
All I am is a kitten

22:16.060 --> 22:19.560
watashi wa koneko

22:19.560 --> 22:23.480
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.560 --> 22:23.480
anata hitori dake no

22:23.480 --> 22:30.370
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:23.480 --> 22:30.370
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.910 --> 22:34.410
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.910 --> 22:34.410
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:34.410 --> 22:38.580
and every last thing that I desire?

22:34.410 --> 22:38.580
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.580 --> 22:42.000
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.580 --> 22:42.000
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:42.000 --> 22:47.920
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:42.000 --> 22:47.920
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.920 --> 22:55.310
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.920 --> 22:55.310
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:55.310 --> 23:02.230
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:55.310 --> 23:02.230
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.860 --> 23:12.370
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.860 --> 23:12.370
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko

23:28.970 --> 23:44.980
Preview

23:29.380 --> 23:30.550
Asami here.

23:30.550 --> 23:32.180
On card: Caba Club - Sakurako

23:31.050 --> 23:35.680
My husband is so kind to everybody that it makes me uneasy.

23:35.680 --> 23:39.100
After all, I'm the one
who loves him the most.

23:39.100 --> 23:43.230
So please, love me lots next week too.
